SUMMARY:Flamenco y Sol: Flamenco at Its Essence
DESCRIPTION:Flamenco y Sol\, in collaboration with Rebeca Tomas and A Palo 
 Seco Flamenco Company\, presents an evening of traditional flamenco in its
  most authentic form\, featuring live music\, improvisation\, and the dyna
 mic interplay between dancer\, singer\, and guitarist. Rooted in the tabla
 o tradition\, the performance highlights the raw emotional power of flamen
 co through cante (song)\, baile (dance)\, and toque (guitar playing). Each
  moment unfolds organically\, offering audiences a direct and immersive ex
 perience of this living art form. Through group choreography and solo mome
 nts\, each artist’s unique voice emerges\, creating a powerful and elect
 rifying theatrical experience. 6:30 PM • Pre-show flamenco lecture by Dr
 . Ana Börger-Greco Presented in partnership with the Skrodinsky Family Fo
 undation.\n\nPrice: Not supplied by this calendar\; check event details\n\
